{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32124","headline":"舞衣曲 · 温庭筠","name":"舞衣曲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"藕肠纤缕抽轻春，烟机漠漠娇娥嚬。\n金梭淅沥透空薄，剪落交刀吹断云。\n张家公子夜闻雨，夜向兰堂思楚舞。\n蝉衫麟带压愁香，偷得莺簧鏁金缕。\n管含兰气娇语悲，胡槽雪腕鸳鸯丝。\n芙蓉力弱应难定，杨柳风多不自持。\n回嚬笑语西牕客，星斗寥寥波脉脉。\n不逐秦王卷象牀，满楼明月梨花白。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"温庭筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32124.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32124","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}